      {
        "category": "summary",
        "text": "Security update for the Linux Kernel RT (Live Patch 2 for SLE 15 SP7)",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for the Linux Kernel 6.4.0-150700_7_8 fixes several issues.\n\nThe following security issues were fixed:\n\n- CVE-2025-38494: HID: core: do not bypass hid_hw_raw_request (bsc#1247350).\n- CVE-2025-38495: HID: core: ensure the allocated report buffer can contain the reserved report ID (bsc#1247351).\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "details",
        "text": "SUSE-2025-2823,SUSE-SLE-Module-Live-Patching-15-SP6-2025-2823,SUSE-SLE-Module-Live-Patching-15-SP7-2025-2824",
